sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Player
    participant LifeManager
    participant GameOverManager
    participant MenuManager
    participant SaveManager
    participant GameOverDisplay

    LifeManager->>GameOverManager: RSO_hearts = 0
    GameOverManager-->>MenuManager: GameOver
    GameOverManager-->>SaveManager: GameOver
    MenuManager->>MenuManager: active GameOverRoot, masque RunRoot
    MenuManager->>GameOverDisplay: active le panel GameOver
    GameOverDisplay->>GameOverDisplay: affiche score, argent, coffre, distance
    SaveManager->>SaveManager: sauvegarde les données dans le JSON
    J->>GameOverDisplay: clic Retour menu
    GameOverDisplay-->>MenuManager: ReturnToMainMenu
    MenuManager->>MenuManager: ShowMainMenu
